{"hw":"πρόσοιδα","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πρόσοιδα</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πρόσοιδα</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> without <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> in use (cf. <span class=\"gk\">Εἴδω</span>), prop. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">know besides</b>: only in phrase <span class=\"gk\">χάριν προσειδέναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">be grateful besides</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χάριν προσείσομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1420</span> </span>.</div></div>"}